Today is Thursday.
It is half past five in the evening.
I am outside a local badminton club.
Today I am very excited.
Sounds of play are coming from the club.
I go inside the club.
The hall is very big.
There is a lot of light in the hall.
There are a few indoor courts here.
Many people are playing on the courts.
I watch their game.
Their rallies are very fast.
I hear the sound of the shuttlecocks and rackets.
I am very excited.
Now I do not go to the gym on Thursdays.
I come here to play.
I also like to play with new people.
I walk towards the reception desk.
